```console
$ scherzo-cloud run input-set --help
Manage Run Input Sets

Usage: scherzo-cloud run input-set [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create  Create a Run Input Set
  delete  Delete a Run Input Set and schedule content cleanup
  seal    Seal a Run Input Set
  show    Show a Run Input Set and its manifest
  upload  Upload members to a Run Input Set
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
